  "project_description": "The Tour module provides users with guided tours of the site interface. Each tour consists of several tips that highlight elements of the user interface, guide the user through a workflow, or explain key concepts of the website.\n\n \n\n Back to top \n\n Improvements from core \n \n Integrated the Tour UI module to provide a visual interface for creating new and editing existing tours \n Almost 4 times as many default Tours \n Improved accessibility \n Settings form to control the label of the button for starting a tour \n The button block for starting a tour to allow to run tours without the toolbar \n \n Disclaimer: Due to Tours being config and possible to be edited on a site basis we will not be doing any Tour or Tip updates retroactively. \n\n Back to top \n\n Extension modules \n \n Tour Extras \n \n Back to top \n\n Config moved to recipes! \n \n Tour Core \n Tour Core Language \n \n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n Since Tour was removed from core a copy of shepherdJs was copied to the module.\n\n Back to top",
